{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"getTags:onFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"getTags:onFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)getTags:onFailure:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"getTags:onFailure:"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"getTags:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSDictionary)","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void (^)(NSDictionary *)"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"successHandler","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"onFailure:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSError)","text":"void (^)(NSError *)","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"errorHandler","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"successHandler","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Block called when tags are successfully retrieved."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Receives a dictionary containing all device tags, or nil if no tags are set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"errorHandler","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Block called if the request fails.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Receives an NSError describing the failure."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alternative method name for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loadTags:error:"},{"text":" following common SDK naming conventions.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Fetches all tags currently associated with this device from the Pushwoosh server."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Verify tag updates were applied:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class TagVerificationService {","","    func verifyTagsApplied(expectedTags: [String: Any],","                          completion: @escaping (Bool) -> Void) {","","        Pushwoosh.configure.getTags({ tags in","            guard let serverTags = tags else {","                completion(false)","                return","            }","","            let allMatch = expectedTags.allSatisfy { key, expectedValue in","                guard let serverValue = serverTags[key] else { return false }","","                if let expected = expectedValue as? String,","                   let server = serverValue as? String {","                    return expected == server","                }","                if let expected = expectedValue as? NSNumber,","                   let server = serverValue as? NSNumber {","                    return expected == server","                }","                return false","            }","","            completion(allMatch)","","        }, onFailure: { error in","            Logger.error(\"Tag verification failed: \\(error?.localizedDescription ?? \"Unknown\")\")","            completion(false)","        })","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Retrieves the current device’s tags from the Pushwoosh server.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/gettags:onfailure:"],"trait